1
00:00:00,083 --> 00:00:04,793
Let's see. Bradley tank.
Transport truck. Batmobile.

2
00:00:04,963 --> 00:00:07,253
(Sheldon:)- Ooh!
- No.

3
00:00:07,674 --> 00:00:11,974
(Howard:)Here we go. Red 2006 Ford Taurus
on the streets of Pasadena.

4
00:00:12,136 --> 00:00:13,636
(Leonard:)Uh...

5
00:00:14,264 --> 00:00:16,054
(Raj:)- What?
- Statistically, red cars...

6
00:00:16,224 --> 00:00:18,764
(Sheldon:)...are stopped by police
far more often than any other color.

7
00:00:18,935 --> 00:00:21,725
(Sheldon:)I don't want any hassles with the fuzz.

8
00:00:22,355 --> 00:00:24,605
Fine, what color do you want?

9
00:00:24,774 --> 00:00:28,694
(Sheldon:)You know the pale blue
of Luke Skywalker's lightsaber?

10
00:00:29,779 --> 00:00:32,949
(Sheldon:)Before it was digitally remastered.

11
00:00:34,826 --> 00:00:36,156
(Howard:)Black it is.

12
00:00:38,121 --> 00:00:42,121
Okay. Now, what you wanna do first
is turn on the ignition and shift into drive.

13
00:00:42,292 --> 00:00:44,292
(Sheldon:)I haven't fastened my seat belt yet.

14
00:00:46,671 --> 00:00:48,421
(Leonard:)Okay, fasten your seat belt.

15
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:57,140
(Sheldon:)Click.

16
00:00:58,975 --> 00:01:01,145
(Sheldon:)- Are there air bags?
- You don't need air bags.

